# This file keeps the empty `assets/` folder in the template.
#
# PRIVATE FOLDER — the designer's own files only.
#
# Drop local-only assets here (DB exports, screenshots, PDFs, etc.).
# Anything you add is ignored by git (see .gitignore) and excluded from
# Vercel deploys (see .vercelignore) — so it is never committed to source
# and never downloadable from the published prototype.
#
# Assets the prototype needs (icons exported from Figma, logos, images)
# do NOT belong here — they would be missing on the deployed link.
# Put those in `images/` at the project root instead.
